  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Protection for Human Rights Defenders across Central America</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xe4;rkt skydd f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsf&#xf6;rsvarare i Centralamerika</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consists in a protection mechanism for human rights defenders in the Latin American countries.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xe4;r en skyddsmekanism f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsf&#xf6;rsvarare i de latinamerikanska l&#xe4;nderna.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching objective of the project is to respond effectively to the security and protection needs of human rights defenders and organizations working in hostile environments, under acute threat, and living and operating in exile in the Mesoamerican region.</narrative>
  </description>
